Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 36. Test d'erreurs - Token invalide
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/resume/{{affilieId}}
Authorization: Bearer token_invalide

### 37. Test d'erreurs - Sans autorisation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/resume/{{affilieId}}

### 38. Test de performance - Dashboard complet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/resume/{{affilieId}}?annee=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 39. Test de performance - Graphiques avec beaucoup de données
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/graphiques/{{affilieId}}?annee=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40. Test de workflow complet - Simulation d'un affilié actif
### 40.1 Récupérer le dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/resume/{{affilieId}}?annee=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40.2 Vérifier les KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/kpis/{{affilieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40.3 Consulter les cotisations récentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/cotisations/recentes/{{affilieId}}?limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40.4 Consulter les prestations récentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/prestations/recentes/{{affilieId}}?limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40.5 Vérifier les alertes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/alertes/cotisation/{{affilieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40.6 Consulter les notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/notifications/{{affilieId}}?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 40.7 Exporter un rapport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboardaffilie/export/cotisations/{{affilieId}}?mois=3&annee=2026&format=PDF
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

